# Firebender Ascension counts a creature attacking, not any triggered ability of a creature you control. Turn 3 Bot1 casts Helpful
# Hunter (its enters trigger is its own ability, caused by it entering) and then attacks with the Soldier token: only the attack counts.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Firebender Ascension
Helpful Hunter
Mountain
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

